<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Allwear in talks, says may be delisted.</title>
<headline>Allwear in talks, says may be delisted.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hicor Ltd and Allwear Ltd said on Friday they were considering proposals, which if successfully consluded, could result in Allwear being delisted from the Johannesburg Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>Shareholders were advised to be cautious in their sharedealings.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
